@methods: worker_saving
# The first-order conditions of the worker's two controls as the method block
# of the policy builder, whose stage file states the maximization alone
# (AMD-MB-001 §4.1): the Euler equations in financial and in pension assets,
# each with its complementarity clause, which read the derivatives of the
# continuation value by the terms D_{y_f}V[>] and D_{y_p}V[>].

[id=foc, (V[>] : ℝ @ !vlu) : !cntn -> (c : ℝ₊₊ @ !ctrl, c_p : ℝ₊ @ !ctrl) : !dcsn] {
    𝑑𝑢(c) = β*D_{y_f}V[>] ⟂ m_f - c - c_p >= 0                  :: [id=euler_financial]
    𝑑𝑢(c) = β*(1 + 𝑑𝜒(c_p))*D_{y_p}V[>] ⟂ 0 <= c_p <= w_d        :: [id=euler_pension]
}
